==Battleground==
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*7 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.
**3 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If one wishes to, they can easily stall all of the Celeboodle spawns before hitting the base. From there, a decent attacking unit can deal with the Li'l Bun Buns without much issue. Maawth and Calamary do not push on their own, making the cleanup of this stage free.

